{"seq":2,"slug":"ui","title":"UI 深度定制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/ui","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"custom-layout","title":"自定义布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/ui/custom-layout","wordCount":633,"readingTime":3},{"seq":2,"slug":"lazy-layout-internals","title":"LazyLayout 内部机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/ui/lazy-layout-internals","wordCount":676,"readingTime":3},{"seq":3,"slug":"graphics-and-canvas","title":"图形与 Canvas 绘制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/ui/graphics-and-canvas","wordCount":522,"readingTime":3}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ui-深度定制\">UI 深度定制</h1><p>当标准 <code>Column</code>/<code>Row</code>/<code>Box</code> 无法满足产品需求时，你需要深入 Compose 的布局协议和绘制系统。本章覆盖三个递进主题：通过 <code>Layout</code> composable 与 <code>MeasurePolicy</code> 实现完全自定义的测量/摆放逻辑；理解 <code>LazyLayout</code> 的虚拟化机制以构建非标准的按需加载视图；以及使用 <code>Canvas</code>/<code>DrawScope</code> API 在像素级绘制复杂图形。</p>\n<p>从&quot;排列规则由你定&quot;到&quot;只渲染可见部分&quot;再到&quot;逐像素控制输出&quot;，本章带你突破 Compose UI 层的天花板，具备从零构建任意复杂界面组件的能力。</p>\n"}